<title>UK: Two Brents cargoes five o'clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>Two Brents cargoes five o'clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The two Brent cargoes turning wet on Friday, the first of the June loading programme, were both five o'clocked, traders said.</p>
<p>They said Suko was clocked with one of the June 1-3  loaders and there was a dispute between Koch and Nova over who was clocked with the second.</p>
<p>-London newsroom, +44 171 542 8145</p>
